# LinkedIn feed store.
#
# Unset: the stub feed is served and the Media section shows its fallback.
# Set: the published Google Sheet is read.
#
# Get this URL from the sheet itself:
#   File > Share > Publish to web > pick the posts tab > Comma-separated values
# It must be the published CSV link on docs.google.com, not the editing URL.
#
# Setup and the Make scenario that fills the sheet are in
# docs/architecture/linkedin-api.md
LINKEDIN_SHEET_CSV_URL=
